                <td class="solution">Prime pump with compatible solvent. Bring up to pressure, carefully remove pump from solvent container and immerse inlet tube into heavy to be sprayed. With nozzle tip removed, trigger gun until heavy material appears at gun. Replace nozzle tip and you&#39;re ready to spray.</td>
            </tr>
